  ('a11', 'ProductGrids', 'Choose any nonempty selection of the four rows, and any nonempty selection of columns. There are fifteen choices each way, giving two hundred and twenty five possible grids. Mathematicians call each of these a rank-one form.', 'Animate row and column masks; count 15 times 15.'),
